  "content": "<p>该模组让你更深入地融入中世纪的氛围，因为它为原版模组添加了来自13至16世纪欧洲各地的全新盔甲、武器和装饰。</p>\n<p><strong>全套镀金模板通常极少由盔甲匠村民出售</strong><br>本项目需要安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights</a>模组及其所有依赖项。大部分纹理和模型由粉丝创作。特别感谢SuperSus890和SteveMc做出的巨大贡献。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1441/931/armor-1-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"984\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1452/66/armor-2-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"984\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1441/938/armor-3-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"984\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1039/408/weapons.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"864\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/543/decorations-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1573\"></p>",
